# Hand-derived expected index frame F-B3 (plan 06-01, D-02, D-18, D-19): the BACKTAB words of F-A3 reinterpreted in Color Stack mode.
# Derivation: docs/video/frame-derivations.md. Written from the card rules before any renderer exists; never produced by a run.
# Plane grammar: 96 rows after the line plane, each 20 groups of 8 symbols (0-9A-F) separated by one space; the 8th symbol of group 20
# is the cut-off pixel of the 7-pixel last column (clip side right) and is written -. The published plane is the 159 columns left of it.
frame F-B3
tier source-expectation
oracle independent-derivation
rules CR-02 CR-06 CR-09 CR-10 CR-11 CR-14
mode cs
display on
border 0
stack 3 6 A D
fill 0400
